Speed: Page.captureScreenshot of format "zebkit-raw", the picture unencoded.

zebkit's native screenshots (<zebkit/automation.h>,
zebkit_automation_screenshot_pixels()) give an application the pixels
themselves, with Page.captureScreenshot's clip, full page, scale and
emulation as they are. The picture of such a capture is not encoded: it is
kept, the data answered is its key, and the engine takes it with
content::protocol::TakeZebkitRawScreenshot(). A 1280 by 800 PNG took 13 ms
to encode; nothing is copied for it but the bitmap's reference.

